{"thread":{"threadID":3855,"boardID":116,"topic":"Jail Server Skin Update","time":1476715135,"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","lastPostTime":1483889296,"lastPoster":"Saitama","replies":21,"views":1599,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":6},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":50906,"threadID":3855,"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","subject":"Jail Server Skin Update","time":1476715135,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":6,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1476716033,"value":1},{"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","time":1476716098,"value":1},{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1476719012,"value":1},{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1476732740,"value":1},{"userID":2101,"username":"Hypnoxas","time":1476738107,"value":1},{"userID":1601,"username":"NostalbierHD","time":1476806665,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>wie gestern auf der Admin-Konferenz abgestimmt und beschlossen, erfolgt heute das Skin-Update auf beiden Jailservern.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Hinzugefügt wurden insgesamt 12 Skins (5 CT / 7 T), von denen 4 Donatorexklusiv sind.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Alle Skins kosten 10.000 Credits (ein hoher Preis, aber Skins sollen im Konzept das exklusivste bleiben).<br>Die Donatorskins werden demnächst noch angepasst mit einem VIP Schriftzug o.Ä..</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Eine Übersicht über alle Skins findet ihr hier:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wir wünschen weiterhin viel Spaß und bitten um Meldungen, falls Bugs auftreten sollten.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>MfG</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>BlackFire</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50907,"threadID":3855,"userID":2165,"username":"O.E.","subject":"","time":1476716031,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Haha ist jaa ma meega geil</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50908,"threadID":3855,"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","subject":"","time":1476716127,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1253-blackfire/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@BlackFire</a> bester Mann, ein Mann ein Wort! Danke wurde Zeit.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50909,"threadID":3855,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1476716194,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1582,"username":"MiKo","time":1477338374,"value":-1},{"userID":2048,"username":"Rebell<3","time":1479338313,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wow, dass kommt nachdem ich alle Credits verschenkt habe, weil ich nichts damit anfangen konnte <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😕</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Dennoch gute Arbeit! <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50911,"threadID":3855,"userID":2104,"username":"EndCockX.","subject":"","time":1476716447,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1582,"username":"MiKo","time":1477338382,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wuhu, es sind Frauen dabei. <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span><br>Ich bedanke mich bei euch!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50912,"threadID":3855,"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","subject":"","time":1476716596,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","time":1476717050,"value":1},{"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","time":1476718064,"value":1},{"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","time":1476723054,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>ApudoX</strong></cite><p>Wow, dass kommt nachdem ich alle Credits verschenkt habe, weil ich nichts damit anfangen konnte<br></p></blockquote><p>Geht mir genau so FeelsBadMan</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>ifZ4ne</strong></cite><p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1253-blackfire/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@BlackFire</a> bester Mann, ein Mann ein Wort! Danke wurde Zeit.<br></p></blockquote><p>Wir nerven ja auch schon seit Monaten damit *siegfürmodels* <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Schade, dass es so &quot;umständlich&quot; mit den Default-Models ist, aber dennoch eine gute Alternative.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Vielen Dank für die Umsetzung <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1253-blackfire/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@BlackFire</a> (!) sollte ich dich mal in Frankfurt treffen gibt&#x27;s ne gratis Rindswurst <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50913,"threadID":3855,"userID":2287,"username":"Krokoblack","subject":"","time":1476720103,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hatte mich schon gewundert was ich da für Playermodels gestern runtegeladen hab.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50922,"threadID":3855,"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","subject":"","time":1476727969,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Gibt es auch Asiaten Playermodel ? xD</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50923,"threadID":3855,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1476728531,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1582,"username":"MiKo","time":1477338353,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Saitama</strong></cite><p>Gibt es auch Asiaten Playermodel ? xD<br></p></blockquote><p><br>Nein, zisch ab <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50927,"threadID":3855,"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","subject":"","time":1476731534,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wäre cool wenn von Zeit zu Zeit noch Playermodels hinzugefügt werden. Bspw. jeden Monat 1T-Skin, jede 2 Monate 1CT-Skin. Oder halt jede 2 Monate 1T-/1CT- Skin.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50937,"threadID":3855,"userID":1806,"username":"sensix","subject":"","time":1476736107,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Freut mich, zu eine positive Entwicklung auf dem Server zu sehen!<br>Die Skins sehen echt gut aus und fördern einfach dieses CSS Jail Feeling</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":50961,"threadID":3855,"userID":1601,"username":"NostalbierHD","subject":"","time":1476806693,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Jetzt bereue ich, dass ich immer meine Credits verschenkt habe :D.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":52330,"threadID":3855,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1479234329,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>User beschweren sich, dass sie Error Meldungen bekommen, wenn andere User die Player Models haben, wie kann man das fixxen?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":52331,"threadID":3855,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1479234368,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Models löschen, neu laden</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":52333,"threadID":3855